Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/rules/index.md` before planning or editing. Then read
the rule file matching the paths in scope and the matching skill in
`.opencode/skills/`.

The non-negotiables are: protected financial values stay byte-identical, no
network egress except `127.0.0.1`, no auto-submit, validated Fulfulde only, and
the repository is source-available under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (not MIT).

The full workflow is in `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`. Run `pnpm ai:check` after changing
any AI configuration, rule or skill.
